{TEXT 287 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 287 105 "Construct an original \+
example of each of the following types of Maple expressions. Check eac
h using both " }{TEXT 279 4 "type" }{TEXT 287 5 " and " }{TEXT 280 10 
"whattype. " }{TEXT 287 25 "Note that in the case of " }{TEXT 281 8 "w
hattype" }{TEXT 287 21 " you may need to use " }{TEXT 282 4 "eval" }
{TEXT 287 151 " as illustrated in the lecture. To separate the example
s make a line using dashes like the following (in text mode) between t
he examples for each type." }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 287 70 "----------
------------------------------------------------------------" }}{PARA 
0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 287 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 205 5 "list\n" }{TEXT
